This wrapper forks bouncemasters_nx (MIT), adopts the portrait presentation
from clayjam_nx (MIT), the networking approach from acpc_nx (MIT) and the
TimeManager clock from badpiggies_nx (MIT) and the JNI layer and GC
bridge from daggerfall_nx (MIT), the software-keyboard editbox from daggerfall_nx
and pvz_fusion_en_nx (MIT), the save.txt design from papapear_nx (MIT), and
descends from the open-source Switch .so-loader lineage by Andy Nguyen
(TheFloW), fgsfds, TheOfficialFloW and Rinnegatamante (MIT). Inherited files
retain their upstream notices. data/cacerts.pem is the Mozilla CA certificate
bundle as shipped by acpc_nx (MPL-2.0).

